Package: com.nktouch.nkcrane
Name: NKCrane
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: NKCrane v1.0 physical-profile container manager. Switches app-owned Documents/Library/tmp/SystemData by transactional on-disk profile swap with rollback, without injecting a tweak into target apps.
